EastSun 20260929: 「你可以再新增一欄 所有頁面選項 方便我換html頁面嗎?」

A new view 頁面 at the top of the HT9045 side bar: every .html of web\page and
web\, grouped by the name before the first dot -- Main / Setup / HW / Data /
Status / Alert / Config / IDE, then 其他 (no Group. prefix: main.html,
eventlog.html ...) and web 根目錄 last -- each group with its page count.
- A page shows its short name (Setup.HotPlate.html -> HotPlate) and its title;
  a forwarding page shows "→ target".
- A click opens it in the designer (an open one comes to the front).
- The active page is marked ● 目前 (orange eye), other open ones ○ 已開啟; on
  every switch the list selects the active page and opens its group.
- Inline / right-click: open the HTML as text beside. Title bar: read again.
- Pages added / removed in the web folder show up by themselves (watcher).
- lib/pagelist.js does the listing (plain Node, tested on its own).

Tests: lib 103 (listPages: every .html once, groups in order, 其他, the
forwarding page), smoke 62 (groups, current mark, open group, a click runs
vscode.openWith with the designer), real VS Code 66 (a click in the real tree
opens Setup.Speed.html; the marks follow: Speed current, HotPlate still open),
probe, panels -- all pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
